{"seq":1,"slug":"regulator-reporting-evidence-retention","title":"监管报告义务、证据链留存与合规审计追溯","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-product-recall-safety-response/recall-compliance-metrics-governance/regulator-reporting-evidence-retention","wordCount":2678,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"监管报告义务-证据链留存与合规审计追溯\">监管报告义务、证据链留存与合规审计追溯</h1><p>召回流程里真正决定企业最终代价的，往往不是召回本身，而是<strong>事后监管问询时你能否把当时的决策、触达与判定用不可篡改的证据重放出来</strong>。美国消费品安全委员会（CPSC）在 <a href=\"https://www.ecfr.gov/current/title-16/chapter-II/subchapter-B/part-1115\">16 CFR Part 1115</a> 里把&quot;报告&quot;和&quot;证据&quot;绑成同一件事：企业一旦获得&quot;合理地支持该产品存在缺陷、可能导致实质性产品危害&quot;的信息即负有报告义务，且监管会<strong>倒推</strong>你本应在何时知道。合规层因此不是记录系统的附属品，而是一条独立设计、独立留存、独立可审计的<strong>证据链</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-报告义务-证据链与审计追溯是三条正交要求\">核心概念：报告义务、证据链与审计追溯是三条正交要求</h2><p>把三者混在一起建模是召回系统最常见的架构错误。**报告义务（reporting obligation）**规定&quot;什么时刻、向谁、交什么内容&quot;——由法域、危害等级、产品类别共同决定，是有法定时钟的对外动作；**证据链（evidence chain）**规定&quot;用什么载体、以什么完整性保证、保存多久&quot;，是对内的存储与不可否认性要求；**审计追溯（audit traceability）**规定&quot;能否在事后用一条事件主线把前两者重组出来&quot;，是查询与重放能力。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[获得可报告信息&lt;br/&gt;投诉/伤害/质检/工程数据] --&gt; B[时钟启动: 归责知识起算点]&#10;  B --&gt; C{危害等级与法域判定}&#10;  C --&gt;|严重危害| D[24小时内初次报告]&#10;  C --&gt;|需调查| E[最长10个工作日调查窗口]&#10;  E --&gt; D&#10;  D --&gt; F[提交纠正措施计划 CAP]&#10;  F --&gt; G[周期性进展报告]&#10;  G --&gt; H[召回终止与结案报告]&#10;  B --&gt; I[证据链写入: WORM + 哈希锚定]&#10;  D --&gt; I&#10;  F --&gt; I&#10;  G --&gt; I&#10;  H --&gt; I&#10;  I --&gt; J[审计追溯: 事件号串起全链可回放]\">flowchart TD\n  A[获得可报告信息&lt;br/&gt;投诉/伤害/质检/工程数据] --&gt; B[时钟启动: 归责知识起算点]\n  B --&gt; C{危害等级与法域判定}\n  C --&gt;|严重危害| D[24小时内初次报告]\n  C --&gt;|需调查| E[最长10个工作日调查窗口]\n  E --&gt; D\n  D --&gt; F[提交纠正措施计划 CAP]\n  F --&gt; G[周期性进展报告]\n  G --&gt; H[召回终止与结案报告]\n  B --&gt; I[证据链写入: WORM + 哈希锚定]\n  D --&gt; I\n  F --&gt; I\n  G --&gt; I\n  H --&gt; I\n  I --&gt; J[审计追溯: 事件号串起全链可回放]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>报告义务</th>\n<th>证据链</th>\n<th>审计追溯</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>核心问题</td>\n<td>何时/向谁/交什么</td>\n<td>存哪/如何防改/存多久</td>\n<td>能否重放并证明无篡改</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时间属性</td>\n<td>法定硬时钟，逾期即违规</td>\n<td>留存期按法域取最长</td>\n<td>回溯任意历史时点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>失败模式</td>\n<td>迟报、漏报、内容缺失</td>\n<td>载体丢失、可被改写</td>\n<td>断链、无时间戳、无法自证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>关键机制</td>\n<td>归责知识+时限计算</td>\n<td>WORM 存储+链式哈希</td>\n<td>事件号主轴+签名回执</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"分法域报告义务的时限与内容清单\">分法域报告义务的时限与内容清单</h2><p>CPSC 体系的时限结构值得逐条拆开，因为它把&quot;你不知道什么时候该知道&quot;这个抗辩点彻底封死。<a href=\"https://www.ecfr.gov/current/title-16/chapter-II/subchapter-B/part-1115\">16 CFR § 1115.14(e)</a> 规定报告义务是&quot;immediately, that is, within 24 hours&quot;；<a href=\"https://www.ecfr.gov/current/title-16/chapter-II/subchapter-B/part-1115\">§ 1115.14(d)</a> 允许一段&quot;合理地迅速&quot;的调查评估期，但<strong>通常不得超过 10 天</strong>，超过须自证其合理性；<a href=\"https://www.ecfr.gov/current/title-16/chapter-II/subchapter-B/part-1115\">§ 1115.14(b)</a> 规定信息送达有报告责任的官员或 CEO 的合理最长时限为 <strong>5 天</strong>，并把该知识<strong>同时归责于企业</strong>。§ 1115.11 进一步确立&quot;归责知识（imputed knowledge）&quot;：企业被视为知道一个合理谨慎的主体在其处境下应当知道的一切，包括&quot;若尽到勤勉调查义务就会知道&quot;的内容。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.ecfr.gov/current/title-21/chapter-I/subchapter-A/part-7/subpart-C\">21 CFR Part 7 Subpart C</a> 则规定：§ 7.53 要求召回企业向 FDA 地区办公室提交<strong>周期性召回进展报告</strong>，间隔一般 <strong>2 到 4 周</strong>；§ 7.59 要求维护产品分销记录，留存期须<strong>超过产品保质期与预期使用期</strong>；§ 7.55 规定召回终止由 FDA 判定。<a href=\"https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/reg/2023/988/oj\">Regulation (EU) 2023/988（GPSR）</a> 第 9(8) 条要求制造商在&quot;认为或有理由相信&quot;产品危险时<strong>立即</strong>采取纠正措施、依第 35/36 条告知消费者，并通过 <strong>Safety Business Gateway</strong> 通知市场监督机构；第 9(3) 条要求技术文档在投放市场后<strong>保存 10 年</strong>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>法域/体系</th>\n<th>初次报告时限</th>\n<th>调查评估窗口</th>\n<th>后续报告节奏</th>\n<th>主要依据</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>美国 CPSC</td>\n<td>24 小时</td>\n<td>≤10 天（须自证延长）</td>\n<td>CAP 生效后按要求进展报告</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.ecfr.gov/current/title-16/chapter-II/subchapter-B/part-1115\">16 CFR 1115</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>美国 FDA</td>\n<td>立即（自愿/应要求）</td>\n<td>卫生危害评估驱动</td>\n<td>每 2–4 周进展报告</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.ecfr.gov/current/title-21/chapter-I/subchapter-A/part-7/subpart-C\">21 CFR 7</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>欧盟 GPSR</td>\n<td>立即</td>\n<td>内部风险评估</td>\n<td>通过 Business Gateway 持续通报</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/reg/2023/988/oj\">Reg (EU) 2023/988</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中国（消费品）</td>\n<td>发现缺陷后按规定时限报告</td>\n<td>缺陷调查</td>\n<td>召回计划备案与进展报告</td>\n<td>市场监管总局《消费品召回管理暂行规定》（总局令第 22 号）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>内容清单同样有硬约束。CPSC <a href=\"https://www.ecfr.gov/current/title-16/chapter-II/subchapter-B/part-1115\">§ 1115.20(a)</a> 列出纠正措施计划（CAP）应含的十余项要素：危害性质与缺陷/不合规类型、受影响产品识别信息、缺陷成因、补救方式（维修/更换/退款）、已售出与仍流通数量估计、公开通知计划、企业签署、以及监管可监督并获取客户名单的承诺。工程含义直接：<strong>CAP 是一份结构化数据对象</strong>，系统须能在提交时从批次谱系、触达统计与补救工单自动汇总这些字段，而非临时人工拼文档。</p>\n<h2 id=\"证据链留存-worm-存储-链式哈希与留存期矩阵\">证据链留存：WORM 存储、链式哈希与留存期矩阵</h2><p>证据链的技术核心是<strong>不可否认性（non-repudiation）</strong>：证明某条记录在某个时刻存在过、且此后未被修改。生产级做法是把每次关键写入序列化为一条<strong>链式哈希</strong>记录，第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 条记录的摘要为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>H</mi><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>∥</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>∥</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h_i = H\\big(h_{i-1} \\parallel t_i \\parallel d_i\\big)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>h</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h_{i-1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9028em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是前一条摘要、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是可信时间戳、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是本次事件载荷的规范化摘要，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span> 为抗碰撞哈希（如 SHA-256）。对历史 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">j&lt;i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span>）的任何篡改都会改变 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，级联破坏其后全部摘要，使篡改可被<strong>单点检测</strong>。这条链必须写入 <strong>WORM（一次写入多次读取）</strong> 存储或对象锁（object lock）桶，使写入在保留期内不可删除、不可覆盖——否则链本身也只是普通日志。可信时间戳须来自独立时间源（RFC 3161 时间戳服务或经审计的公证锚），不能信任业务主机自身的时钟。</p>\n<p>留存期不能取单一值，应取<strong>适用法域中的最长者</strong>再向上取整，因同一批货可能同时落在多个法域：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>证据类别</th>\n<th>典型最短留存期</th>\n<th>起算点</th>\n<th>依据示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>制造商技术文档</td>\n<td>10 年</td>\n<td>产品投放市场</td>\n<td>GPSR 第 9(3) 条</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>消费者投诉内部登记</td>\n<td>目的所需，个人数据不超过 5 年</td>\n<td>数据录入</td>\n<td>GPSR 第 9(13) 条</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分销/批次谱系记录</td>\n<td>超过保质期与预期使用期</td>\n<td>分销发生</td>\n<td>21 CFR § 7.59</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>触达与回执证据</td>\n<td>覆盖召回有效性检查期</td>\n<td>通知发出</td>\n<td>召回有效性检查要求</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一个易被忽略的张力：<strong>GPSR 第 9(12) 条要求保留投诉与召回内部登记，第 9(13) 条又要求其中个人数据在调查所需之外不超过 5 年</strong>。这迫使证据链在设计时把<strong>个人数据与事件元数据分层</strong>——事件主线、哈希、时间戳长期留存（可 10 年以上），而买家身份、联系方式等 PII 走独立的、到期自动脱敏的存储，脱敏行为本身也记一条审计事件。用一条链混存二者，会要么违反数据最小化与留存限制，要么把可审计的事件骨架一起销毁。审计追溯的上游数据基础见同 hub 的 <a href=\"../safety-signal-risk-data-system/traceability-batch-genealogy-query\">批次追溯与谱系查询</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"合规审计追溯-把事件号做成可回放的主轴\">合规审计追溯：把事件号做成可回放的主轴</h2><p>检验标准很具体：<strong>监管方给出一个日期和一个批次，系统能否在十分钟内产出&quot;那一刻我们知道什么、据此做了什么、向谁报告&quot;的完整时序？</strong> 能，就是可追溯。实现方式是把每次召回绑定到一个<strong>事件号（incident ID）</strong>，并强制所有子系统（信号采集、危害评分、批次定界、触达执行、补救工单、监管提交）都以该事件号作为写入门径键。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  I[Incident ID 事件号] --&gt; S1[安全信号与投诉&lt;br/&gt;含采集时间戳]&#10;  I --&gt; S2[危害评分与判定&lt;br/&gt;含模型版本与输入快照]&#10;  I --&gt; S3[批次谱系定界&lt;br/&gt;含受影响订单集合]&#10;  I --&gt; S4[多通道触达与回执]&#10;  I --&gt; S5[补救工单与退款记录]&#10;  I --&gt; S6[监管提交与回执编号]&#10;  S1 --&gt; T[时序重放: 按 UTC 排序的全链视图]&#10;  S2 --&gt; T&#10;  S3 --&gt; T&#10;  S4 --&gt; T&#10;  S5 --&gt; T&#10;  S6 --&gt; T&#10;  T --&gt; V[审计输出: 决策依据 + 证据摘要 + 签名]\">graph TD\n  I[Incident ID 事件号] --&gt; S1[安全信号与投诉&lt;br/&gt;含采集时间戳]\n  I --&gt; S2[危害评分与判定&lt;br/&gt;含模型版本与输入快照]\n  I --&gt; S3[批次谱系定界&lt;br/&gt;含受影响订单集合]\n  I --&gt; S4[多通道触达与回执]\n  I --&gt; S5[补救工单与退款记录]\n  I --&gt; S6[监管提交与回执编号]\n  S1 --&gt; T[时序重放: 按 UTC 排序的全链视图]\n  S2 --&gt; T\n  S3 --&gt; T\n  S4 --&gt; T\n  S5 --&gt; T\n  S6 --&gt; T\n  T --&gt; V[审计输出: 决策依据 + 证据摘要 + 签名]</pre><p>这里的状态机必须是<strong>只追加（append-only）<strong>的：任何更正都以新事件追加、标注被更正的原事件，而非原地修改。这与事件溯源（event sourcing）同构，但它不是架构偏好而是</strong>合规要求</strong>——监管会追问&quot;你在 T1 时点的判定依据是什么&quot;，若数据库允许覆盖，你无法自证当时看到的是哪一版数据。对外提交必须保存<strong>回执与确认号</strong>，因为&quot;我提交了&quot;与&quot;监管收到了&quot;是两件不同的事实。</p>\n<h2 id=\"时限计算与时钟治理\">时限计算与时钟治理</h2><p>时限看似日历问题，跨境场景下是工程问题。CPSC <a href=\"https://www.ecfr.gov/current/title-16/chapter-II/subchapter-B/part-1115\">§ 1115.14(a)</a> 明确<strong>周末与节假日不计入</strong>期限计算，系统必须内置<strong>按法域配置的工作日历</strong>。若起算时刻为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，法域 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span></span> 的可用工作时间为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>eff</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">∣</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>t</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">∣</mo><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mtext>workday</mtext><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mtext>true</mtext><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">∣</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta t_{\\text{eff}} = \\Big|\\{\\, t \\in [t_0,\\ t_0+\\Delta t_{\\max}] \\;\\big|\\; \\text{workday}_j(t) = \\text{true} \\,\\}\\Big|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">eff</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.8em;vertical-align:-0.65em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.15em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.15em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.8em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.333em;height:1.8em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.333em\" height=\"1.8em\" viewBox=\"0 0 333 1800\"><path d=\"M145 15 v585 v600 v585 c2.667,10,9.667,15,21,15\nc10,0,16.667,-5,20,-15 v-585 v-600 v-585 c-2.667,-10,-9.667,-15,-21,-15\nc-10,0,-16.667,5,-20,15z M188 15 H145 v585 v600 v585 h43z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.65em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2302em;vertical-align:-0.3802em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.85em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.85em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.333em;height:1.2em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.333em\" height=\"1.2em\" viewBox=\"0 0 333 1200\"><path d=\"M145 15 v585 v0 v585 c2.667,10,9.667,15,21,15\nc10,0,16.667,-5,20,-15 v-585 v0 v-585 c-2.667,-10,-9.667,-15,-21,-15\nc-10,0,-16.667,5,-20,15z M188 15 H145 v585 v0 v585 h43z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.35em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">workday</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3802em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.8em;vertical-align:-0.65em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">true</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.15em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.15em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.8em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.333em;height:1.8em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.333em\" height=\"1.8em\" viewBox=\"0 0 333 1800\"><path d=\"M145 15 v585 v600 v585 c2.667,10,9.667,15,21,15\nc10,0,16.667,-5,20,-15 v-585 v-600 v-585 c-2.667,-10,-9.667,-15,-21,-15\nc-10,0,-16.667,5,-20,15z M188 15 H145 v585 v600 v585 h43z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.65em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>只有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>eff</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta t_{\\text{eff}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">eff</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 达到阈值才触发升级。跨法域时取最紧期限作内部截止：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>internal</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>J</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mtext>deadline</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{internal}} = \\min_{j \\in J}(T_{\\text{deadline},j}) - \\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">internal</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">deadline</span></span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span> 是内部安全余量（建议取该法域人工审批链路的预期耗时）。逾期成本可量化：CPSA 第 20 条（<a href=\"https://www.law.cornell.edu/uscode/text/15/2069\">15 U.S.C. § 2069</a>）规定故意违反者每项违规最高 <strong>$100,000</strong> 民事罚款，相关联的一系列违规合计上限 <strong>$15,000,000</strong>，每五年按通胀调整；<a href=\"https://www.ecfr.gov/current/title-16/chapter-II/subchapter-B/part-1119\">16 CFR Part 1119</a> 列出罚金裁量因素（含是否及时报告、是否配合）。&quot;迟报&quot;本身即可独立于危害结果被处罚。分法域通报时限与监管接口的完整对照见同 hub 的 <a href=\"../recall-regime-liability-model/notification-timeline-regulator-interface-map\">分法域通报时限与监管接口矩阵</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>召回合规层的三条要求——报告义务、证据链、审计追溯——必须并行设计，且都要能在事后自证：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>报告义务按时钟治理</strong>：CPSC 的 24 小时初次报告、最长 10 天调查窗口、5 天知识归责上限构成可倒推的硬约束；FDA 每 2–4 周的进展报告和 GPSR 的&quot;立即&quot;通知各有其节奏，系统须按法域配置工作日历并保留内部安全余量。</li>\n<li><strong>证据链靠技术而非流程</strong>：只追加写入 + WORM 存储 + 链式哈希 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>∥</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>∥</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h_i = H(h_{i-1} \\parallel t_i \\parallel d_i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> + 独立可信时间戳，才能提供不可否认性；留存期取适用法域最长者，并把 PII 与事件骨架分层以同时满足留存与数据最小化。</li>\n<li><strong>审计追溯以事件号为主轴</strong>：所有子系统以 incident ID 为写入门径键、只追加更正、保存对外提交回执，才能回答&quot;那一刻我们知道什么、据此做了什么、向谁提交了&quot;。</li>\n<li><strong>逾期是可量化的风险</strong>：CPSA 第 20 条每项违规上限 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>100</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">100,000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">000</span></span></span></span></span>、系列上限 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>15,000,000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">15{,}000{,}000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">15</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span></span><span class=\"mord\">000</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span></span><span class=\"mord\">000</span></span></span></span></span> 美元，使报告时限治理具有直接的财务回报。</li>\n<li><strong>内容清单即数据结构</strong>：CAP 的十余项法定要素应能从批次谱系、触达统计与补救工单自动汇总，而非临时人工编写。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"监管报告义务、证据链留存与合规审计追溯","id":"监管报告义务-证据链留存与合规审计追溯"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：报告义务、证据链与审计追溯是三条正交要求","id":"核心概念-报告义务-证据链与审计追溯是三条正交要求"},{"level":2,"text":"分法域报告义务的时限与内容清单","id":"分法域报告义务的时限与内容清单"},{"level":2,"text":"证据链留存：WORM 存储、链式哈希与留存期矩阵","id":"证据链留存-worm-存储-链式哈希与留存期矩阵"},{"level":2,"text":"合规审计追溯：把事件号做成可回放的主轴","id":"合规审计追溯-把事件号做成可回放的主轴"},{"level":2,"text":"时限计算与时钟治理","id":"时限计算与时钟治理"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"跨境逆向物流、退款补救与合规销毁处置","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-product-recall-safety-response/crossborder-recall-execution/reverse-logistics-refund-disposal"},"next":{"title":"召回成本核算、责任敞口与保险理赔衔接模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-product-recall-safety-response/recall-compliance-metrics-governance/recall-cost-liability-exposure-model"}}